{"4419320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scourge Realms", "steam_appid": 4419320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4765770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scourge Realms</strong> is an Action-RPG set in an era of chaos due to various realms being inflicted with an evil scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero tasked with entering these hostile realms to slay hordes of monsters to defeat the scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/012169161b6ca75c8d5ce960ee3cc8ea.poster.avif?t=1787628117\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/012169161b6ca75c8d5ce960ee3cc8ea.webm?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/012169161b6ca75c8d5ce960ee3cc8ea.mp4?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Survive :</strong> Endure hordes of enemies in scourge inflicted realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Loot :</strong> Collect powerful randomly generated gear dropped from monsters in true classic ARPG fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Meta Progression :</strong> Your skills and items found will enable you accumulate permanent power between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Enchanting :</strong> Use materials found in realms to enchant gear. Create unique builds utilizing various enchantment combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Risk/Reward Gameplay :</strong> In between realms, you must choose between different modifier sets that will alter the realm. Some modifier sets will have bonuses that benefit the player such as increasing item drops from monsters. On the other hand there will be modifiers that increase monster power in return. Choose wisely as taking on too much can result in you being felled by the scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Escalating difficulty :</strong> Unlock higher tiers of game difficulty. Monsters in higher difficulty tiers will be more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loot dropped from monster will be more plentiful and powerful as players progress through harder content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/79543b57bc5b2c5ec5dec779d598c8e7.poster.avif?t=1787628117\" width=352 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/79543b57bc5b2c5ec5dec779d598c8e7.webm?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/79543b57bc5b2c5ec5dec779d598c8e7.mp4?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Can you defeat the Scourge?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scourge Realms</strong> is an Action-RPG set in an era of chaos due to various realms being inflicted with an evil scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero tasked with entering these hostile realms to slay hordes of monsters to defeat the scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/012169161b6ca75c8d5ce960ee3cc8ea.poster.avif?t=1787628117\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/012169161b6ca75c8d5ce960ee3cc8ea.webm?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/012169161b6ca75c8d5ce960ee3cc8ea.mp4?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Survive :</strong> Endure hordes of enemies in scourge inflicted realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Loot :</strong> Collect powerful randomly generated gear dropped from monsters in true classic ARPG fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Meta Progression :</strong> Your skills and items found will enable you accumulate permanent power between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Enchanting :</strong> Use materials found in realms to enchant gear. Create unique builds utilizing various enchantment combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Risk/Reward Gameplay :</strong> In between realms, you must choose between different modifier sets that will alter the realm. Some modifier sets will have bonuses that benefit the player such as increasing item drops from monsters. On the other hand there will be modifiers that increase monster power in return. Choose wisely as taking on too much can result in you being felled by the scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Escalating difficulty :</strong> Unlock higher tiers of game difficulty. Monsters in higher difficulty tiers will be more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loot dropped from monster will be more plentiful and powerful as players progress through harder content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/79543b57bc5b2c5ec5dec779d598c8e7.poster.avif?t=1787628117\" width=352 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/79543b57bc5b2c5ec5dec779d598c8e7.webm?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/extras/79543b57bc5b2c5ec5dec779d598c8e7.mp4?t=1787628117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Can you defeat the Scourge?</i></p>", "short_description": "Slay monsters in evil realms inflicted with scourge. Find Majestic Loot, Collect powerful enchanting materials and xp to survive the scourge and obtain god-like power.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/8772b343e5cc31708b32638ecd0a88267a2c66bd/header.jpg?t=1787628117", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/db8a7bb2d2e34adbdc840fa70604a09efed045e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787628117", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/db8a7bb2d2e34adbdc840fa70604a09efed045e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787628117", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Etheric Origin"], "publishers": ["Etheric Origin"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/046102f78a373cac192d5d37eaa6591d598a9671/ss_046102f78a373cac192d5d37eaa6591d598a9671.600x338.jpg?t=1787628117", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419320/046102f78a373cac192d5d37eaa6591d598a9671/ss_046102f78a373cac192d5d3